cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LEXIMETRA in published work, cite the released version you actually
  ran. The pipeline's output can change between releases, so a bare repository
  URL does not identify what produced a given set of reaction times.
title: LEXIMETRA
abstract: >-
  A desktop tool for automatic trial analysis and reaction-time verification of
  speech-response audio sessions. Detects onset cue beeps, cuts trials, marks
  speech onsets with Silero VAD, and computes per-trial reaction times, which
  are then checked and corrected by hand.
type: software
authors:
